NOTES FOR WHOEVER READS THIS LATER
  - The policy's own advice applies to me as well: I did not open the editor, did not create a project and
    did not call invoke. Feasibility was established from the filesystem and process environment only,
    which is the safe subset.
  - If the LCEDA rule set grows, keep rule 9 as an index. Growing it into a full copy here would recreate
    the two-sources-of-truth problem that this whole structure exists to avoid.